## Mitigations in place (for context)

- **Recovery is clean**: SIGTERM via the Resources process manager — no reboot, no hard GPU lock. GuC stays alive (logging + ~21 ms heartbeat), so this is a stall, not a wedge.
- **Keep the model resident** — faults correlate with idle-timeout unload / context teardown 
- **Ruled out**: thermal / power — 52 W idle, 170–180 W full load, max observed 212 W, well under the ~230 W ceiling (no throttling / headroom issue).
- **Awaiting upstream fix** (7.0.0-43+ / 7.1).

